@startuml
title exact-orb — N7: double click, retry и idempotency key

autonumber
hide footbox

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #2563EB
    LifeLineBorderColor #64748B
    LifeLineBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    ParticipantBorderColor #64748B
    ParticipantFontColor #0F172A
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
    ActorBorderColor #64748B
    ActorFontColor #0F172A
    ActorBackgroundColor #DBEAFE
    GroupBorderColor #94A3B8
    GroupHeaderFontColor #1E293B
    DividerBorderColor #94A3B8
    DividerFontColor #1E293B
    NoteBorderColor #94A3B8
    NoteBackgroundColor #FFFBEA
    NoteFontColor #334155
}

actor "Пользователь" as User

box "CLIENT / API" #DBEAFE
    boundary "Frontend" as FE
    boundary "FastAPI" as API
end box

box "APPLICATION" #FFEDD5
    control "Orchestrator" as Orch
    control "BuildNatalHandler" as Handler
end box

box "SESSION STATE" #D1FAE5
    control "ContextService" as Context
    database "Session Store" as Store
end box

box "CALCULATION" #FFF7CC
    control "ChartArtifactResolver" as Artifact
    control "CalculationEnginePort" as Engine
end box

User -> FE : Нажимает «Построить»
FE -> FE : generate idempotency_key = X\nrequest_fingerprint = F

FE -> API : POST /charts/natal\nkey=X, fingerprint=F
API -> Orch : BuildNatalCommand

Orch -> Context : register_or_get_build(X, F)
Context -> Store : atomic lookup / insert
Store --> Context : CREATED run A\nrevision=N, status=PROCESSING
Context --> Orch : run A created

Orch ->> Handler : execute(run A)
Handler ->> Artifact : ensure_natal(A)
Artifact ->> Engine : calculate(A)

== Повторная доставка того же логического запроса ==

FE -> API : retry / double click\nkey=X, fingerprint=F
API -> Orch : same BuildNatalCommand
Orch -> Context : register_or_get_build(X, F)
Context -> Store : lookup idempotency key
Store --> Context : EXISTING run A\nstatus=PROCESSING
Context --> Orch : existing run A
Orch --> API : 202 ExistingBuild(run_id=A)
API --> FE : тот же run_id; новый расчёт не создан

Engine --> Artifact : ChartArtifact A
Artifact --> Handler : ChartArtifact A
Handler --> Orch : BuildCompleted A
Orch -> Context : commit_build_success(A)
Context -> Store : atomic commit profile\n+ mark idempotency result completed
Store --> Context : committed
Context --> Orch : success

== Retry после завершения ==

FE -> API : повтор key=X, fingerprint=F
API -> Orch : BuildNatalCommand
Orch -> Context : register_or_get_build(X, F)
Context -> Store : lookup
Store --> Context : EXISTING COMPLETED run A
Context --> Orch : completed result reference
Orch --> API : existing BuildResult A
API --> FE : тот же логический результат

alt Тот же key X использован с другим payload
    FE -> API : key=X, fingerprint=F2
    API -> Orch : conflicting request
    Orch -> Context : register_or_get_build(X, F2)
    Context -> Store : compare fingerprint
    Store --> Context : IDEMPOTENCY_KEY_REUSED
    Context --> Orch : conflict
    Orch --> API : 409 IDEMPOTENCY_KEY_REUSED
    API --> FE : client error
end

note over Handler, Engine
Для key=X запускается максимум один Engine calculation
и выполняется максимум одна мутация SessionProfile.
Idempotency key не увеличивает build_revision при duplicate delivery.
end note

@enduml
